  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.4 adds plugin and adapter lifetime scopes, named JSON services and the plugin event bus. The SDK includes the [PluginContract]/[PluginJson] source generator: callers import a provider DLL at build time, with no shared contract assembly at runtime. Plugins register authenticated Dashboard component pages through IBotContext.Dashboard; the host renders component trees, validates forms and declared actions, and handles uploads and files. AddWebPage registers embedded self-contained HTML in an opaque-origin sandbox with a page-scoped authenticated bridge. RequestAsync accepts page-local HTTP routes, multipart and binary input, and returns streamed IResult responses; browser request() preserves status, content headers, Range and cancellation. Breaking change: IPluginServices no longer inherits IServiceProvider; RegisterSingleton<T>, GetService<T> and GetRequiredService<T> are removed. Consumers of those APIs must migrate to named JSON services or generated contracts and rebuild. SDK ABI 1.5.0.0; QQ Model ABI 1.1.0.0, Discord Model ABI 1.1.0.0, Telegram Model ABI 1.1.0.0. These APIs require host 1.0.4.",
